      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Went yesterday to get pool stuff for my kids and onesies and diapers for my baby.\n\n\nJacob (@monorchus)\n\nLike she's been to a Target in her entire  life.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/monorchus/status/2065625347517997129#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2065625757489983943",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-13T02:42:12+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Have you been to Target lately and seen all the America/Fourth of July clothes and swag completely sold out?\n\nDoes the person who wrote this actually live in America?\n\n\nThe New Yorker (@NewYorker)\n\nIn a nation of plummeting pride and MAGA hats, \u201cpatriotism just isn\u2019t cool anymore,\u201d Arthur Krystal writes. newyorker.com/magazine/2026/\u2026\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/NewYorker/status/2065237656804733295#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2065400300345680062",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-12T11:46:19+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Horrific and barbaric, these stupid insane horse drawn carriages in New York city should have been banned decades ago.\n\n\nBreaking911 (@Breaking911)\n\nA horse pulling a carriage in New York City\u2019s Central Park collapsed and died Tuesday evening near Strawberry Fields, according to witnesses and animal welfare advocates. The incident occurred around 7:30 p.m., with the horse reportedly dying minutes after collapsing.\n\nThe death comes just days before supporters of Ryder\u2019s Law are set to rally at Ci",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2064863117243265417",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-11T00:11:45+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Jimmy Kimmel is a mean, heartless bastard and no amount of on air crying will convince me or anyone else otherwise. The day he is off air will be a better day for the country.\n\n\nTMZ (@TMZ)\n\n\ud83d\ude05 Jimmy Kimmel trolls Spencer Pratt, rents him a U-Haul to leave L.A. after election loss. \n\nCredit: ABC\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/TMZ/status/2064705495001096317#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2064788141576274050",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-10T19:13:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
